From: Birk Skyum <birk.skyum@pm.me>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 21:49:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: arm: qcom: Add the ASUS Vivobook 16 (X1607QA)

The ASUS Vivobook 16 X1607QA is built on the Snapdragon X X1-26-100.
Add its compatible to the X1-26-100 boards.

Signed-off-by: Birk Skyum <birk.skyum@pm.me>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml
index e96f49a..fe3a381 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml
@@ -1282,6 +1282,7 @@ properties:
 
       - items:
           - enum:
+              - asus,vivobook-x16
               - lenovo,ideapad-slim3
           - const: qcom,x126100
           - const: qcom,x1p42100
-- 
2.47.3

